TIP:  This is not the Marvel's version, it's the one by The Mavericks from the movie Apollo 13.  Remember, nice and slow. 

TIP:  There's a bass vibe to the chord cadence and if you can, cover the bass (f) note while playing the (F) by wrapping your thumb over the top string at the 1st fret.  You may have to lift off the 1st string to do so, so just don't strum the 1st string.  Otherwise just play (F) as usual and try not to strike the top string.

TIP:  The first (G7) in the verse ("dream" and "saying" etc.) sounds off to some.  You can play a (G) or an (Em) if it sounds better to you, but the second (G7) should be played.

    
